# Original Aurum wording and ordering for the existing southern route.
# Quest identities/objectives checked in current Forever reference data.
# Factual route comparison: Polestar 04-redridge-mountains (GPL-3.0-only),
# installed RXP Forever Alliance-11-20, and the private purchased reference.
# No elite Keep clear or mandatory Keeshan escort; avoid release escort queues.

step Lakeshire errands
  zone Redridge Mountains
  accept 126 lvl 15
  note Keep Howling in the Hills for our level-24 visit; do not fight Yowler now.
  tip Cross the bridge into town. Take Verner's follow-up after the earlier gnoll kills, Marris's outdoor tasks near the bridge, and Baren's fish work at the docks. Keep at least two free quest slots for follow-ups.
  accept 20 lvl 18
  accept 98387 lvl 18
  accept 150 lvl 20
  accept 127 lvl 16
  vendor nearest
  note Check your remaining drinks and repair now. Do not buy a new stack if the previous town visit left enough usable drinks.

step Southern lake shore
  tip Work along the murloc shore east of the bridge for both fish and fins. Pull murlocs away from their neighbours and stop once both objectives are complete.
  collect 1467 quest 127.1
  collect 1468 quest 150.1

step Blackrock supplies on the southern hills
  tip Continue east along the southern side of the lake to the outdoor Blackrock camp. Take weapons from racks and supply containers from the ground while clearing ordinary orcs for axes. Outrunners can net you: keep a clear retreat path and stay out of Stonewatch's elite keep.
  collect 280841 quest 98387.1 @68.91,79.00 live
  collect 280839 quest 98387.2 @68.91,79.00 live
  collect 3014 npc 440 quest 20.1 @68.91,79.00 live

step Cash in the Redridge loop
  tip Return west along the lake road to Lakeshire and deliver every completed task before leaving. If an objective remains unfinished, finish its marked outdoor area now; do not carry these local quests into the next zone.
  turnin 150
  turnin 127
  turnin 98387
  turnin 20
  vendor nearest
  note The next chapter resumes Duskwood. Shadow Magic, the elite keep bosses, and the escort are not needed for that handoff.
